      "act": "COLD-OPEN",
      "lane": "BOOKEND",
      "narration_text": "Sawubona — Liam here, in for Bear. You type one sentence into an AI. It can end up in four different places, and people talk about all four as if you're equally in control of them. You're not. Three of them you can walk back out of. One of them you can't.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 15,
