    {
      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "THE-DETAIL",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Start with the detail. One sentence, three facts: you have a partner, they hike, you live near Denver. Harmless on its own. Also enough to put you, roughly, on a map.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 11,
      "shot": {
        "type": "PANTRY",
        "source": "own",
        "file": "B01-916.mp4"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B01.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.19,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B01.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "THE-DETAIL",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Not where does it go. Which of these can I walk back out of. Every level has a door. Three of them open both ways.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 8,
      "shot": {
        "type": "PANTRY",
        "source": "own",
        "file": "B04-916.mp4"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B04.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 6.42,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B04.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "LEVEL-1-CONVERSATION",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Open a fresh chat tomorrow and it starts blank. Not discreet — empty. On its own, the model has no idea your partner hikes, and no way to find out unless you tell it again.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 11,
      "shot": {
        "type": "PANTRY",
        "source": "own",
        "file": "B06-916.mp4"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B06.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.98,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B06.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "LEVEL-1-CONVERSATION",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "So the first door swings both ways. Close the tab and the detail is gone from the only place it was living. Level one costs you nothing. Almost everything you ever type stops here.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 11,
      "shot": {
        "type": "PANTRY",
        "source": "own",
        "file": "B07-916.mp4"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B07.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.45,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B07.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B08",
      "act": "LEVEL-2-MEMORY",
      "lane": "BOOKEND",
      "narration_text": "Level two is where the language gets sloppy. So let's ask for the mechanism instead of the marketing.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 7,
      "shot": {
        "type": "REMOTION",
        "source": "own",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "ClaudeComposerAsk916",
          "props": {
            "greeting": "The mechanism,",
            "command": "Show me what \"the model remembers me\" actually means — mechanically, step by step.",
            "topic": "CLAUDE BASICS · WHERE YOUR DATA GOES",
            "segment": "Product Memory",
            "runningText": "resolving the mechanism…",
            "output": [],
            "folderLabel": "@NikBearBrown"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B08.mp4",
            "at": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B08.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 6.19,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B08.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "act": "LEVEL-2-MEMORY",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Here's what that phrase hides. The model did not remember you. A file on your account did — and that file gets read into the blank chat before you finish typing your first word.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 11,
      "shot": {
        "type": "PANTRY",
        "source": "own",
        "file": "B09-916.mp4"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B09.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.54,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B09.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B10",
      "act": "LEVEL-2-MEMORY",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "That distinction isn't pedantry, it's the whole point. A memory you can open is a memory you can edit. In most products you can read the file, change a line, clear it, or switch the whole thing off.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 12,
      "shot": {
        "type": "PANTRY",
        "source": "own",
        "file": "B10-916.mp4"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B10.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.62,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B10.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B12",
      "act": "LEVEL-3-PROVIDER",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Level three isn't the model at all. It's the provider's own machinery — keeping the service up, reviewing for abuse, fixing bugs, research, and depending on the company, commercial uses too.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 12,
      "shot": {
        "type": "PANTRY",
        "source": "own",
        "file": "B12-916.mp4"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B12.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.56,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B12.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B13",
      "act": "LEVEL-3-PROVIDER",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Your three facts sit in that machinery for a retention period. And here is the part worth saying plainly: the period is real, it's usually written down, and it is not yours.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 11,
      "shot": {
        "type": "PANTRY",
        "source": "own",
        "file": "B13-916.mp4"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B13.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.6,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B13.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B14",
      "act": "LEVEL-3-PROVIDER",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Third door still opens both ways — past a clock you don't wind. You can ask for deletion. You don't set the interval. That's not sinister, it's operational.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 10,
      "shot": {
        "type": "PANTRY",
        "source": "own",
        "file": "B14-916.mp4"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B14.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.62,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B14.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B15",
      "act": "LEVEL-3-PROVIDER",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "But notice what changed. This is the first level where being in control stops meaning you can undo it, and starts meaning you can file a request and wait.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 10,
      "shot": {
        "type": "PANTRY",
        "source": "own",
        "file": "B15-916.mp4"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B15.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.68,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B15.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B17",
      "act": "LEVEL-4-TRAINING",
      "lane": "MANIM",
      "narration_text": "And then your sentence stops being a sentence. It becomes a very small adjustment to how likely certain words are to follow other words. Not a record of you. A pattern.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 11,
      "shot": {
        "type": "PANTRY",
        "source": "own",
        "file": "B17-916.mp4"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B17.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.15,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B17.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B19",
      "act": "LEVEL-4-TRAINING",
      "lane": "BODY",
      "narration_text": "Where providers train on conversations, most let you opt out — and you should go find that toggle. But understand what it buys. It protects every conversation after you flip it. Not one before.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 12,
      "shot": {
        "type": "PANTRY",
        "source": "own",
        "file": "B19-916.mp4"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B19.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.52,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B19.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-13T23:37:45"
      },
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "BOUT",
      "act": "OUTRO",
      "lane": "BOOKEND",
      "narration_text": "That's the short version. The full video also covers Level one is the conversation…, Second door still swings both… and Level four is training. Some… — watch Three You Can Take Back. One You Can't. for the whole story. The link is right below.",
